  "sourceCaveats": [
    "The index says 2001 is unavailable. No 2001 file is linked.",
    "The republished 2002 and 2003 workbooks already contain the eight weather-zone columns, despite the older index description of a 2003 transition.",
    "The source-labelled 1997 ZIP 97frc714.zip actually contains 1996 EEI load files and companion forecasts. Do not infer operating dates from index year labels.",
    "The 1998 workbook contains load-serving-entity columns plus control-area mappings; it reports kW, not the same weather-zone table shape.",
    "The 2026 ZIP was downloaded twice with identical bytes and identical failed CRC. The reader propagates the integrity failure.",
    "Native Load 2016 contains a timestamp for November 6 hour 24 with all nine load values absent. These are None, not zero."
  ],
